# Immediate Food Delivery II

## Problem Summary

Write a query to calculate the percentage of customers whose first order was delivered immediately, rounded to 2 decimal places.

## Solution

```sql
select round(avg(order_date = customer_pref_delivery_date) * 100, 2) as immediate_percentage from delivery 
where(customer_id, order_date) in(Select customer_id, min(order_date) from delivery group by customer_id)
```
